  "document": "Katrina Begin\nKatrina Begin( born August 10, 1982 in Minneapolis, Minnesota) is an American actress. She is perhaps best known for her role as Sylvia in the 2007 film\" Remember the Daze\". In television, she guest starred on\" Grounded for LifeE- RingERGossip Girl The ProtectorAfter Lately\" and had a four- episode on\" No Ordinary Family\" from 2010 to 2011. As well as appearing in the films\" Pretty Little Devils\"( 2008) and\" Zookeeper\"( 2011)."
